# The Astro/Cloudflare Pages site itself reads no environment variables at
# build or runtime -- the RSVP/album-notify webhook URLs come from
# src/content/site/site.json, not env vars. WEBHOOK_SECRET and DASHBOARD_PIN
# used to be documented here, but both belong to the Cloudflare Worker
# (priya-sankar-invite-webhook-proxy) instead, and DASHBOARD_PIN specifically
# is dead code now that the /dashboard route has been removed.
#
# For the Worker's local dev secrets, see worker/.dev.vars.example.
